{"slug":"w-s-e","ar":"و س ع","total":32,"core":"vastness; capacity; abundance","forms":[{"ar":"وَٰسِع","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":9,"gloss":"The All-Encompassing","word":"al-wasi","ex":{"s":4,"a":130,"p":10,"ar":["وَإِن","يَتَفَرَّقَا","يُغْنِ","ٱللَّهُ","كُلًّا","مِّن","سَعَتِهِۦ ۚ","وَكَانَ","ٱللَّهُ","وَٰسِعًا","حَكِيمًا"],"en":"But if they separate [by divorce], Allah will enrich each [of them] from His abundance. And ever is Allah Encompassing and Wise"}},{"ar":"سَعَة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":6,"gloss":"abundance, ample means","word":null,"ex":{"s":4,"a":130,"p":7,"ar":["وَإِن","يَتَفَرَّقَا","يُغْنِ","ٱللَّهُ","كُلًّا","مِّن","سَعَتِهِۦ ۚ","وَكَانَ","ٱللَّهُ","وَٰسِعًا","حَكِيمًا"],"en":"But if they separate [by divorce], Allah will enrich each [of them] from His abundance. And ever is Allah Encompassing and Wise"}},{"ar":"وَسِعَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":6,"gloss":"to encompass, extend over","word":null,"ex":{"s":20,"a":98,"p":9,"ar":["إِنَّمَآ","إِلَـٰهُكُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلَّذِى","لَآ","إِلَـٰهَ","إِلَّا","هُوَ ۚ","وَسِعَ","كُلَّ","شَىْءٍ","عِلْمًا"],"en":"Your god is only Allah, except for whom there is no deity. He has encompassed all things in knowledge"}},{"ar":"وُسْع","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":5,"gloss":"capacity","word":null,"ex":{"s":23,"a":62,"p":5,"ar":["وَلَا","نُكَلِّفُ","نَفْسًا","إِلَّا","وُسْعَهَا ۖ","وَلَدَيْنَا","كِتَـٰبٌ","يَنطِقُ","بِٱلْحَقِّ ۚ","وَهُمْ","لَا","يُظْلَمُونَ"],"en":"And We charge no soul except [with that within] its capacity, and with Us is a record which speaks with truth; and they will not be wronged"}},{"ar":"وَٰسِعَة","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"vast, spacious","word":null,"ex":{"s":29,"a":56,"p":6,"ar":["يَـٰعِبَادِىَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","إِنَّ","أَرْضِى","وَٰسِعَةٌ","فَإِيَّـٰىَ","فَٱعْبُدُونِ"],"en":"O My servants who have believed, indeed My earth is spacious, so worship only Me"}},{"ar":"مُوسِع","kind":"active participle","form":4,"cou